xt":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/scrollTransition(topLeading:bottomTrailing:axis:transition:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/scrolltransition(topleading:bottomtrailing:axis:transition:)","title":"scrollTransition(topLeading:bottomTrailing:axis:transition:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/scrollTransition(topLeading:bottomTrailing:axis:transition:)","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scrollTransition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"topLeading","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI29ScrollTransitionConfigurationV","text":"ScrollTransitionConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", "